    "detailed_description": "Build it. Bump it.<br><br>Inspired by the cult-classic <i>Jump 'n Bump</i>, <i>Build 'n Bump</i> adds a creative twist: before you fight, you build the battlefield.<br><br>Up to 6 players can duke it out in fully customizable arenas. Stomp on heads to score points, avoid traps, and knock your friends into pixelated chaos. Use five unique block types to shape the arena before each round, or try Level Master Mode, where one player edits the map <i>in real time</i> while the match is happening.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Highlights</h2><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Local multiplayer for 2-6 players (4 controllers + 2 on keyboard)<br><br>\ud83c\udf10 Online multiplayer via direct IP or Steam Remote Play*<br><br>\ud83e\uddf1 Build with 5 block types: standard, spring, platform, spike, and dissolving<br><br>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Level Master Mode where 1 player edits live while others battle<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Practice mode with stationary targets<br><br>\ud83d\udcbe Unlimited level save slots<br><br>\ud83c\udfa9 Custom hats! Drop your own images into the &quot;hats&quot; folder to wear during battle<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note on Online Play</h2><br>Online mode supports only one connection between two computers via direct IP. Familiarity with port forwarding is required. There are no dedicated servers or public lobbies, but Steam Remote Play Together is a great alternative for most players.",
    "about_the_game": "Build it. Bump it.<br><br>Inspired by the cult-classic <i>Jump 'n Bump</i>, <i>Build 'n Bump</i> adds a creative twist: before you fight, you build the battlefield.<br><br>Up to 6 players can duke it out in fully customizable arenas. Stomp on heads to score points, avoid traps, and knock your friends into pixelated chaos. Use five unique block types to shape the arena before each round, or try Level Master Mode, where one player edits the map <i>in real time</i> while the match is happening.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Highlights</h2><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Local multiplayer for 2-6 players (4 controllers + 2 on keyboard)<br><br>\ud83c\udf10 Online multiplayer via direct IP or Steam Remote Play*<br><br>\ud83e\uddf1 Build with 5 block types: standard, spring, platform, spike, and dissolving<br><br>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Level Master Mode where 1 player edits live while others battle<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Practice mode with stationary targets<br><br>\ud83d\udcbe Unlimited level save slots<br><br>\ud83c\udfa9 Custom hats! Drop your own images into the &quot;hats&quot; folder to wear during battle<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note on Online Play</h2><br>Online mode supports only one connection between two computers via direct IP. Familiarity with port forwarding is required. There are no dedicated servers or public lobbies, but Steam Remote Play Together is a great alternative for most players.",
